Vani (VaniVoice AI) — FDE-Readiness Audit
Repo: biswal-prem-5677/Vani-VoiceAgent · commit 0055de9 (8 commits) · audited 27 Nov 2026 · Node 22.23
1. Verdict
Not industry/FDE-ready yet. It is a strong prototype with a fixable, bounded list of blockers. The architecture ideas are good (tenant isolation, consent and retention, audit log, signed webhooks, confirmation gate). The problems are mostly in the details underneath those ideas, and several are exploitable or unsafe. I confirmed the important ones by running the code, not just reading it.
